{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","神肃诛伐"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","神の誅伐"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对累计造成伤害最高的敌人造成高额的真实伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","合計与ダメージが最も高い敵に高い確定ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动的，阿塔利娅拥有强大的意志，在被击败后会化身为圣辉骑枪继续留在战场上攻击敌人，但攻击力会降低35%。\n主动释放时，阿塔利娅跳跃到空中，随后对累计造成伤害最高的敌人降下天罚，对目标造成150% + 27% ATK的真实伤害，附加等同于所有敌人累积损失的生命值30% + 3%的真实伤害，该附加伤害最多不超过自身1500% + 150% ATK，并使其倒地0.5秒，期间自身处于无敌状态。随后，清空本技能对所有敌人累积损失的生命值的计数。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：強い意志を持つアタリアは、撃破されると聖なるランスに変化し、フィールド上に残って敵を攻撃する。この場合、自身の攻撃力-35%\nアクティブ効果：空中にジャンプし、合計与ダメージが最も高い敵に天罰を下し、150% + 27% ATKの確定ダメージを与え、追加で「敵全体のHP減少量の合計値」×30% + 3%の確定ダメージを与え、対象を0.5秒間ノックダウンさせる。発動中、自身は無敵状態になる。この追加ダメージは自身の1500% + 150% ATKを超えない。その後、「敵全体のHP減少量の合計値」のカウントをリセット"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":133,"end":138,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":161,"end":168,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":111,"end":117,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":154,"end":159,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":220,"end":227,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":93,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":156,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":189,"end":191,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":107,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":195,"end":197,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":215,"end":231,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，对目标造成的真实伤害提升至180% + 27% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の攻撃力に基づく確定ダメージが180% + 27% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，对目标造成的真实伤害提升至210% + 27% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の攻撃力に基づく確定ダメージが210% + 27% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，对目标造成的真实伤害提升至240% + 27% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の攻撃力に基づく確定ダメージが240% + 27% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，对目标造成的真实伤害提升至270% + 27% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果の攻撃力に基づく確定ダメージが270% + 27% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusR